        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/zelda-botw-header-artwork.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>I was in the gift shop of a small art gallery the other day when I bought a postcard depicting a bunch of different keys. The postcard turned out to be a reproduction from the six-volume dictionary and encyclopedia Larousse du XXe si&egrave;cle (me neither) and the keys come in a gorgeous range of shapes and sizes. The Roman key is broad and boot-shaped. The Merovingian looks like part of a crank.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/the-pure-and-scattered-beauty-of-modern-zelda\">Read more</a></p>",
